<title>USA: Holly Corp q1 shr $0.39 vs $0.74.</title>
<headline>Holly Corp q1 shr $0.39 vs $0.74.</headline>
<dateline>DALLAS 1996-12-12</dateline>
<text>
<p>Holly Corp announced its results for the first quarter ended October 31.</p>
<p>					   1996			1995</p>
<p> Shr primary		$0.39		    $0.74</p>
<p> Net			  3,208		    6,103</p>
<p> Revs		     186,946		  164,838</p>
<p> Avg shrs primary	 8,254		  8,254</p>
<p>(All data above 000s except per share numbers. The company said the decrease in its first-quarter earnings from a year earlier was primarily due to reduced refinery margins. It was also duein part to a small decrease in refined product sales volumes.)</p>
</text>
